{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントたくさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、そうなの。\n着物着て「若女将！若女将！」\nって一人ではしゃいでたよ。\nそんでいっぱい写真撮って\n終始どや顔だったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着付け習いたいなあ。\n柄とかレトロなのがいいなあ。\n来年は着物で初詣行きたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は久しぶりに\n美容室に行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪があまりにも長くて大変だったので\n軽く切ってもらおうと思ったけど\nなんか調子に乗って切り過ぎました。\n15㎝も切りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15㎝って..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定規やん！！！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ってびっくりしたけど\nこの長さって初期と\n同じくらいなんだよね。\n前髪無かった時代。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで伸ばし過ぎてたんだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふんふん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、またすぐ伸びるから\n大丈夫さっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後は服とか買って帰りました。\n安くなってたしっっ！うはー\n福袋買ってないんだー\n毎年買ってないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握で着ようかな♪\n着物は着ません♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人ショッピング楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ってからはこの前買った\nポストカードとか\n置物とか飾ったりした。楽しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n幕張全握はゆったんとペアだよ。\nいちばん端っこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/03/1700563/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「待ってるぜ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}